{
  "schema": "eqexport-map-provenance-fixture-v1",
  "purpose": "Normative cross-language examples for fingerprints derived from post-two-decimal Valve-220 values. Hash SHA-256 over UTF-8 preimages. Quantize with sign(x) * floor(abs(x) * scale + 0.5), converting negative zero to zero.",
